sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Support agent
    participant G as Gateway
    participant C as Coordinator
    participant T as Ticket Ops Agent
    participant R as Resolution Agent
    participant API as Ticket API
    A->>G: "Summarise T-1042 and suggest a reply"
    G->>C: request + identity + per-turn handle
    C->>T: get ticket + messages (MCP, read-only)
    T-->>C: summary + similar tickets
    C->>R: draft reply using KB (internal allowed)
    R-->>A: assistant_draft (internal) + suggested action (refund 40 USD)
    A->>G: "Propose the refund"
    G->>C: request
    C->>R: propose_action(refund, O-5001, 40)
    R->>API: create pending approval with action_hash (refused if one is already pending)
    R-->>A: "Sent for approval. Ticket is pending_approval."
    A->>G: review and edit the draft, send as public comment
    G->>API: add_comment (public) under the staff identity
    API-->>A: comment sent (never sent by the assistant)
